{"title":"약사의 혼잣말(마오마오의 후궁 수수께끼 풀이수첩) [단행본]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=bHPfsT/dJMcaaGk0xB/GN1o3xihYssFsYI1HMlZNk&filename=th3","synopsis":"유괴당한 끝에 어느 대국의 후궁에 팔려온 약사 소녀 마오마오.\n\n마오마오는 몸값을 다 갚을 때까지 얌전히 있자고 결심하지만, 어느 날 황제의 자식들에게 의문사가 잇따르고 있다는 것을 알게 된다. \n\n호기심과 약간의 정의감, 그리고 약사의 지식을 살려 수수께끼를 조사하기 시작한 이후, 마오마오의 운명은 크게 변하는데…?\n\n‘소설가가 되자’의 대히트 이색 미스터리, 대망의 코미컬라이즈!! ©Natsu Hyuuga,Touko Shino / Shufunotomo Infos Co.,LTD.\n©Minoji Kurata / SHOGAKUKAN","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":127,"change":{"type":"down","amount":41}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":151,"change":{"type":"down","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":127,"change":{"type":"up","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":90,"change":{"type":"up","amount":37}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":181,"change":{"type":"down","amount":91}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":157,"change":{"type":"up","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":110,"change":{"type":"up","amount":47}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":167,"change":{"type":"down","amount":57}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":180,"change":{"type":"down","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":50,"change":{"type":"up","amount":130}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":128,"change":{"type":"down","amount":78}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":177,"change":{"type":"down","amount":49}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":105,"change":{"type":"up","amount":72}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":283,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":253,"change":{"type":"up","amount":30}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":235,"change":{"type":"up","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":232,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":277,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":255,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":266,"change":{"type":"down","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":219,"change":{"type":"up","amount":47}},{"